Acceptance criteria:
Every existing README interaction GIF is freshly recorded, with new DS and
lighting demonstrations and useful captions. Actual native game frames come
from the owner's supplied GBA and DS cartridges, never a composited display.
Show the fixed tripod lamp, independent room lights, Pear 10-100% and off,
Axolotl Sleep50%/Bright100% and off, movable light pools and lifted/dropped
companions. Do not imply the fixed tripod is movable. Preserve six Pear
freckles, approved animated logos, unrelated dirty PNGs and the frozen book.
Keep ROMs, raw videos and private receipts local; publish only intended media.
Keep rendering/material defaults and existing CI gates. Separate media capture
from universal game compatibility, audio, phone performance or owner approval.

